# A list comprehension that filters its elements: how many there are depends on the instance.
-- source.cue --
items: [...{title: string, keep: bool}]
-- target.cue --
items: [...{name: string}]
-- lens.cue --
v0_0: _
v1_0: {items: [for item in v0_0.items if item.keep {name: item.title}]}
-- out --
unknown
v1_0.items filters list elements with if item.keep, so how many there are depends on the instance; map every element (rule unknown-dynamic) @ lens.cue:2:8
